WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I want to go into the community and have a look.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,000
Of course no problem

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,000
But

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
What about our community?

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,400
It’s a high-end private community

6
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,400
Generally, outsiders are not allowed to come in and out at will.

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,000
I understand, I understand, senior

8
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Such an important place

9
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,400
We really shouldn't come in and out casually

10
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,400
I took the liberty

11
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,400
That being the case

12
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,000
Then senior, I won’t bother you.

13
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,000
I'm leaving first

14
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,800
What is important or not?

15
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,000
Don't leave in a hurry

16
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,600
What about me?

17
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,000
Most like to help others

18
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Seeing as you want to enter the community so much?

19
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,800
I can let you in once

20
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,800
Thank you, senior

21
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,000
Thank you, senior

22
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,200
Don't be in a hurry to thank me yet

23
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,200
Let you in

24
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,680
He’s not a senior without any conditions.

25
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,080
what does this mean
